<title>AUSTRIA: TENNIS-CA TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CA TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $800,000 CA Trophy</p>
<p>men's tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat 6-Marcelo Rios (Chile) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat David Prinosil (Germany) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Gianluca Pozzi (Italy) 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (12-10) 6-3</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Boris Becker (Germany) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 7-6 (7-2) 3-6 6-4</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 6-4  </p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>7-Todd Martin (U.S.) beat Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
